[
 {
  "text": "Every sneeze teleports you.",
  "start": 0.0,
  "end": 1.255,
  "startFrame": 0,
  "endFrame": 38,
  "words": [
   0,
   3
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Last week I sneezed once, and I ended up in the middle of a frozen forest, holding a cat.",
  "start": 1.509,
  "end": 5.258,
  "startFrame": 45,
  "endFrame": 158,
  "words": [
   4,
   22
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Let me explain.",
  "start": 5.478,
  "end": 5.936,
  "startFrame": 164,
  "endFrame": 178,
  "words": [
   23,
   25
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "In this world, every time you sneeze, you teleport to whatever you were thinking about.",
  "start": 6.157,
  "end": 9.26,
  "startFrame": 185,
  "endFrame": 278,
  "words": [
   26,
   40
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Whatever you're holding comes with you.",
  "start": 9.43,
  "end": 10.617,
  "startFrame": 283,
  "endFrame": 319,
  "words": [
   41,
   46
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "So pepper is sold only with a prescription.",
  "start": 10.787,
  "end": 12.483,
  "startFrame": 324,
  "endFrame": 374,
  "words": [
   47,
   54
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "In spring, airports are empty, because why fly when you can just sniff a flower?",
  "start": 12.771,
  "end": 15.909,
  "startFrame": 383,
  "endFrame": 477,
  "words": [
   55,
   69
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Bless you means goodbye.",
  "start": 16.146,
  "end": 17.13,
  "startFrame": 484,
  "endFrame": 514,
  "words": [
   70,
   73
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My grandma once sneezed while holding her couch.",
  "start": 17.435,
  "end": 19.08,
  "startFrame": 523,
  "endFrame": 572,
  "words": [
   74,
   81
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "She landed in Paris, still sitting on it.",
  "start": 19.301,
  "end": 20.946,
  "startFrame": 579,
  "endFrame": 628,
  "words": [
   82,
   89
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My dad sneezed thinking about a sandwich.",
  "start": 21.065,
  "end": 22.591,
  "startFrame": 632,
  "endFrame": 678,
  "words": [
   90,
   96
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "He woke up inside a sandwich shop in Ohio, wearing pajamas.",
  "start": 22.786,
  "end": 25.22,
  "startFrame": 684,
  "endFrame": 757,
  "words": [
   97,
   107
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "And at my uncle's wedding, the groom sneezed during the vows while thinking about his ex.",
  "start": 25.525,
  "end": 28.833,
  "startFrame": 766,
  "endFrame": 865,
  "words": [
   108,
   123
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "There was no wedding.",
  "start": 29.087,
  "end": 29.647,
  "startFrame": 873,
  "endFrame": 889,
  "words": [
   124,
   127
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm Sam.",
  "start": 29.884,
  "end": 30.223,
  "startFrame": 897,
  "endFrame": 907,
  "words": [
   128,
   129
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I have the worst allergies in town.",
  "start": 30.478,
  "end": 31.733,
  "startFrame": 914,
  "endFrame": 952,
  "words": [
   130,
   136
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Cats, dust, flowers, everything.",
  "start": 31.987,
  "end": 33.683,
  "startFrame": 960,
  "endFrame": 1010,
  "words": [
   137,
   140
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I've taken pills every morning since I was four.",
  "start": 33.955,
  "end": 35.684,
  "startFrame": 1019,
  "endFrame": 1071,
  "words": [
   141,
   149
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Last year I sneezed thinking about a giraffe and woke up in a zoo in Kenya.",
  "start": 35.888,
  "end": 38.636,
  "startFrame": 1077,
  "endFrame": 1159,
  "words": [
   150,
   165
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I haven't sneezed since.",
  "start": 38.907,
  "end": 39.704,
  "startFrame": 1167,
  "endFrame": 1191,
  "words": [
   166,
   169
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Then one night, my little sister Mia chased a stray cat into the woods.",
  "start": 39.975,
  "end": 42.91,
  "startFrame": 1199,
  "endFrame": 1287,
  "words": [
   170,
   183
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "A snowstorm hit.",
  "start": 43.164,
  "end": 43.859,
  "startFrame": 1295,
  "endFrame": 1316,
  "words": [
   184,
   186
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "The search teams couldn't find her.",
  "start": 44.046,
  "end": 45.182,
  "startFrame": 1321,
  "endFrame": 1355,
  "words": [
   187,
   192
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Nobody could.",
  "start": 45.403,
  "end": 45.878,
  "startFrame": 1362,
  "endFrame": 1376,
  "words": [
   193,
   194
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "But I didn't need to know where she was.",
  "start": 46.047,
  "end": 47.404,
  "startFrame": 1381,
  "endFrame": 1422,
  "words": [
   195,
   203
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I just needed to think about her and sneeze.",
  "start": 47.404,
  "end": 49.405,
  "startFrame": 1422,
  "endFrame": 1482,
  "words": [
   204,
   212
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My pills were still working.",
  "start": 49.626,
  "end": 50.474,
  "startFrame": 1489,
  "endFrame": 1514,
  "words": [
   213,
   217
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My nose was dead.",
  "start": 50.694,
  "end": 51.508,
  "startFrame": 1521,
  "endFrame": 1545,
  "words": [
   218,
   221
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "So I broke into grandma's secret pepper drawer, opened the whole grinder, and breathed it in like a vacuum cleaner.",
  "start": 51.831,
  "end": 55.85,
  "startFrame": 1555,
  "endFrame": 1676,
  "words": [
   222,
   241
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My eyes watered.",
  "start": 56.139,
  "end": 56.749,
  "startFrame": 1684,
  "endFrame": 1702,
  "words": [
   242,
   244
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "My brain screamed.",
  "start": 56.97,
  "end": 57.835,
  "startFrame": 1709,
  "endFrame": 1735,
  "words": [
   245,
   247
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I thought about Mia's face as hard as I could.",
  "start": 58.14,
  "end": 59.921,
  "startFrame": 1744,
  "endFrame": 1798,
  "words": [
   248,
   257
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Achoo!",
  "start": 60.243,
  "end": 60.497,
  "startFrame": 1807,
  "endFrame": 1815,
  "words": [
   258,
   258
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Snow.",
  "start": 60.803,
  "end": 61.057,
  "startFrame": 1824,
  "endFrame": 1832,
  "words": [
   259,
   259
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Darkness.",
  "start": 61.379,
  "end": 61.6,
  "startFrame": 1841,
  "endFrame": 1848,
  "words": [
   260,
   260
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "And right in front of me, Mia, shivering, hugging that stray cat.",
  "start": 61.956,
  "end": 64.568,
  "startFrame": 1859,
  "endFrame": 1937,
  "words": [
   261,
   272
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "She smiled.",
  "start": 64.771,
  "end": 65.212,
  "startFrame": 1943,
  "endFrame": 1956,
  "words": [
   273,
   274
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I knew you'd come.",
  "start": 65.45,
  "end": 66.026,
  "startFrame": 1964,
  "endFrame": 1981,
  "words": [
   275,
   278
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "But I had no pepper left.",
  "start": 66.247,
  "end": 67.282,
  "startFrame": 1987,
  "endFrame": 2018,
  "words": [
   279,
   284
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "No way home.",
  "start": 67.536,
  "end": 68.028,
  "startFrame": 2026,
  "endFrame": 2041,
  "words": [
   285,
   287
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Then I looked at the cat.",
  "start": 68.265,
  "end": 69.164,
  "startFrame": 2048,
  "endFrame": 2075,
  "words": [
   288,
   293
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm allergic to cats.",
  "start": 69.351,
  "end": 70.267,
  "startFrame": 2081,
  "endFrame": 2108,
  "words": [
   294,
   297
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I grabbed Mia, grabbed the cat, and pushed my face right into its fur.",
  "start": 70.436,
  "end": 73.167,
  "startFrame": 2113,
  "endFrame": 2195,
  "words": [
   298,
   311
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I thought about our kitchen.",
  "start": 73.421,
  "end": 74.133,
  "startFrame": 2203,
  "endFrame": 2224,
  "words": [
   312,
   316
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Achoo!",
  "start": 74.49,
  "end": 74.761,
  "startFrame": 2235,
  "endFrame": 2243,
  "words": [
   317,
   317
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "We landed right on the kitchen table, in front of Mom.",
  "start": 74.948,
  "end": 76.796,
  "startFrame": 2248,
  "endFrame": 2304,
  "words": [
   318,
   328
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Mom cried and hugged us so hard I could barely breathe.",
  "start": 77.085,
  "end": 79.374,
  "startFrame": 2313,
  "endFrame": 2381,
  "words": [
   329,
   339
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "We kept the cat.",
  "start": 79.679,
  "end": 80.188,
  "startFrame": 2390,
  "endFrame": 2406,
  "words": [
   340,
   343
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Now I sneeze forty times a day.",
  "start": 80.375,
  "end": 81.698,
  "startFrame": 2411,
  "endFrame": 2451,
  "words": [
   344,
   350
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "Yesterday, I thought about pizza.",
  "start": 81.918,
  "end": 82.953,
  "startFrame": 2458,
  "endFrame": 2489,
  "words": [
   351,
   355
  ]
 },
 {
  "text": "I'm writing this from Italy.",
  "start": 83.241,
  "end": 83.953,
  "startFrame": 2497,
  "endFrame": 2519,
  "words": [
   356,
   360
  ]
 }
]